OL,3,AArgentine leader threatens to sanction
OL,4,Aoil firms and reiterates Falklands
OL,5,Aclaim
OL,6,
OL,7,FArgentina's president has heightened
OL,8,Ftensions with the UK over the Falkland
OL,9,FIslands, warning he will impose
OL,10,Feconomic sanctions on firms which
OL,11,Fexploit oil close to the British
OL,12,Foverseas territory.
OL,14,FIn a national address, Javier Milei
OL,15,Fsaid the "winds of change" favoured
OL,16,FArgentina's claim to the islands,
OL,17,Femboldened by signs the US might
OL,18,Freconsider its stance of neutrality on
OL,19,Fthe issue.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,109,105,200,300,0,100
